Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黎明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daybreak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火炉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Furnace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.41,0:01:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,善良\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Benign{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回祖国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Homecoming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.45,0:01:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.33,0:01:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火车货车车厢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freight car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.90,0:01:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿意服从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to comply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.21,0:01:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个任务要交给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a mission for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:01:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,制裁和取回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sanction and extract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不留活口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No witnesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得好 士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done Soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.39,0:03:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(拉各斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(现今)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看见什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, what do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.94,0:03:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普通的片区巡警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standard beat cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小警局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.28,0:03:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(警察局)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,街区安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个不错的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,南角有台自动取款机 也就是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an ATM in the south corner, which means...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.29,0:03:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有摄像头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cameras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两条交叉街道都是单行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both cross streets are one way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不算是很好的逃跑路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So compromised escape routes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.01,0:03:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说我们的目标不在乎被看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means our guy doesn't care about being seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不怕在逃跑时造成混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he isn't afraid to make a mess on the way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到半个街区外的那辆逍遥了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that Range Rover halfway up the block?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到了 红色那辆吗 还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the red one. It's cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且是防弹的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's also bullet proof,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意味着是私人保安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which means private security,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也意味着更多枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which means more guns,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意味着会让某些人更加头疼 比如我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which means more headaches for somebody, probably us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.62,0:03:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道我能用意念移动物体吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys know I can move things with my mind, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心谨慎必须成为你的本能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking over your shoulder needs to become second nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人跟你说过你有点多疑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody ever tell you, you're a little paranoid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没当面说过 怎么 你听到什么了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to my face. Why, did you hear something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 精神集中点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes on target, folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是半年来最可靠的关于朗姆洛的线索了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the best lead we've on Rumlow in 6 months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想跟丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to lose him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他看到我们 那就不是问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he sees us coming that won't be a problem,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他算是恨死我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he kind of hates us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 看到那辆垃圾车了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, see that garbage truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.25,0:04:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,追踪它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tag it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.93,0:04:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进行X光扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me X-ray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0018,,(重量分析: 货物重13825公斤)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(最大载重)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(轮廓扫描)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.09,0:04:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡车达到了最大载重 驾驶员有枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That truck's loaded for max weight, and the driver's armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是辆冲撞车 - 行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a battling ram. - Go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:04:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的目标不是警察局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not hitting the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(传染性疾病研究所)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,防弹衣都是AR15\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Body armor. AR15s{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发现七名敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make 7 hostiles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.39,0:06:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还剩五个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make 5.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,四个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朗姆洛在三层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rumlow's on the third floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 旺达 就像练习时那样 - 那毒体呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wanda. Just like we practice. - What about the gas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吸出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(生物危害品)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,装走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pack it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(发射)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 朗姆洛拿走了生物武器 - 我这就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rumlow has a biological weapon. - I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不怕这招了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't work like that no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手雷来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire in the hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.07,0:08:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 他开装甲战车向北走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam. He's in an AFV heading north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把这个带去机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this to the airstrip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跑不过他 弃车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not gonna out run him. Lose the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.37,0:09:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你去哪和我们汇合 - 我们不汇合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going to meet us? - I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到四个 他们分头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got 4, they're splitting up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我负责左边两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the two on the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把装备扔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They ditched their gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得靠猜了 只有一个人拿走了武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shell game now. One of them has the payload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.22,0:09:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这儿呢 你个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are, you son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一刻我等好久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been waiting for this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,东西不在他这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.11,0:10:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:10:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就把这个扔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or I'll drop this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 放下枪 - 他说到做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Drop it! - He'll do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,武器拿到了 谢谢 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Payload secured. Thanks, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别谢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't thank me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.41,0:11:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我才不要谢那东西 - 他叫红翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not thanking that thing. - His name is Redwing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我还是不会谢它 - 他多可爱 摸摸他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm still not thanking it. - He's cute. Go ahead, pet him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这下是为了你拿大楼砸我的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is for dropping a building on my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.91,0:11:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到种种情况 我觉得我看起来还算不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I look pretty good, all things considered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.91,0:12:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的买家是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's your buyer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.31,0:12:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他认得你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know he knew you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那个朋友 好哥们 你的巴基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pal, your buddy, your Bucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么 - 他记得你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you say? - He remembered you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当时在场 他还泪汪汪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was there. He got all weepy about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.35,0:12:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他们就又把他的脑子搅乱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Till they put put his brain back in the blender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.05,0:12:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他想告诉你句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted you to know something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他对我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said to me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"请转告罗杰斯"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Please tell Rogers,"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"该走的时候 就得走"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"When you gotta go, you gotta go."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得随我一起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're coming with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 我们需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam. We need...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.25,0:12:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,消防救援 在大楼南面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire and rescue, on the south side of the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.91,0:12:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得马上上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to get up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 尽量记住九月的美好 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Try to remember the kind of September ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 那时草地仍碧绿 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ When grass was green... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒 孩子 跟你父亲告别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, dear. Say goodbye to your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沙发上的流浪汉是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the homeless person on the couch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我爱回家过圣诞的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is why I love coming home for Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们就要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right before you leave town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好说话 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be nice, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他出国留学好容易回来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been studying abroad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 学的哪个姑娘 她叫什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, which broad? What's her name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坎迪斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Candice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你 周一之前别把房子烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do me a favour. Try not to burn the house down before Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 那就周一再烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so it's Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.34,0:13:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 我会据此安排我长袍派对的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is good to know. I will plan my Toga party accordingly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where're you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲要带我去巴哈马群岛渡个假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father's flying us to the Bahamas for a little get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许得先去一趟别处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We might have to make a quick stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去五角大楼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the Pentagon. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定会喜欢那里餐厅的节日菜单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna love the holiday menu at the commissary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据说讽刺是衡量一个人潜力的标准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, they say sarcasm is a metric for potential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真是这样 你以后一定能成为一个伟人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's true, you'll be a great man some day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去拿包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get the bags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不在的时候他非常想念你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He does miss you when you are not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说 你也会想我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And frankly, you're going to miss us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这是我们最后一次在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because this is the last time we're all going to be together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.59,0:14:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道后来发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what's about to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说点什么吧 不说你会后悔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say something. If you don't, you'll regret it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I knew you did the best you could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望事情是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how I wished it happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二元扩张倒退框架 简称"二扩"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Binarily Augmented Retro-Framing... or "BARF".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.71,0:14:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 这缩写还得好好想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I got to work on that acronym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一种极其昂贵的通过控制海马体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An extremely costly method, of hijacking the hippocampus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,清除创伤记忆的手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to clear... traumatic memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.40,0:15:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这无法改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't change the fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们根本没能到达机场的事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that they never made it to the airport,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是我为了逃避悲伤所做的那些事 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the things I did to avoid processing my grief. But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再者 我这个治疗实验花费了6.11亿美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus, 611 million dollars for my little therapeutic experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任何一个正常人都不会赞助这个项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one in their right mind would ever funded it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,提醒我一下 麻省理工的宗旨是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me out. What's the MIT mission statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,创造 传播和保护知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To generate, disseminate and preserve knowledge,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与他人协作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and work with others,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽全力去挑战世界的极限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to bring to bear on the world's great challenges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.53,0:15:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们 就是他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you, are the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.66,0:15:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管没有大肆宣传 你们所面临的挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And quiet as it's kept the challenges facing you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是人类所遭遇的最严峻的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are the greatest mankind has ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另外 你们大多数都破产了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus, most of you are broke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者说 你们之前是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also, rather you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即刻生效 在座各位都将得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As of this moment, every student has been made an equal recipient{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九月基金的拨款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the inaugural September Foundation Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.26,0:16:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说 你们所有人的项目都得到批准资助了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As in, all of your projects have just been approved and funded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有附加条款 不收税\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No strings. No taxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放手去 改变未来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just... reframe the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.89,0:16:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从现在开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starting now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(现在我要请出基金负责人  派珀·波茨)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别怕犯错 放手做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go break some eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我简直 真是要窒息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That uh... That took my breathe away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尼 太慷慨了 那么多钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, so generous, so much money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.11,0:16:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我出于好奇问一句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... Out of curiosity and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拨款会有一部分给教职工吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will any portion of that grant be made available to faculty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 真没品 但听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, ew, gross, but hear me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个关于自熟热狗的绝妙点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have got this killer idea for a self cooking hotdog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.31,0:16:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,基本上就是嵌入化学引燃剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Basically, chemical detonator embedded...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洗手间在这边吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Restroom's this way, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 嵌在肉架中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Embedding in the meat shaft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克先生 提词器的事很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark, I am so sorry about the telepromter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道波茨女士不来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know Miss Potts has canceled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:16:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们没来得及改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They didn't have time to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.12,0:17:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事 我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fine. I..I..I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.38,0:17:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们等下再聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll catch up later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.76,0:17:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为那些年轻人做的事真是不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was nice, what you did for those young people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们应得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, they deserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也让我的良心好过些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus it helps ease my conscious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.71,0:17:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据说慷慨与内疚是有关联的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say, there's a correlation between generosity and guilt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你有的是钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you got the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.79,0:17:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以尽情犯错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break as many eggs as you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要上去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.25,0:17:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就想待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm right where I want to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行了 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.43,0:18:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 职业病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, it's an occupational hazard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在国务院工作 人力资源部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work for the State department. Human resources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这很无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it's boring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.10,0:18:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这让我能养活我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, it enabled me to raise a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很为他的成长骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very proud of what he grew up to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他叫查理·斯宾塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name was Charlie Spencer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your murdered him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在索科威亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Sokovia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 这对你来说毫不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that that matters in the least to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你为我们而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you fight for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实你只是为自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just fight for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会为我儿子复仇 斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's going to avenge my son, Stark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.79,0:18:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了 都怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead. And I blame you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上月 在尼日利亚拉各斯 11名瓦坎达公民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}11 Wakandans were among those killed during a confrontation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在复仇者联盟与雇佣兵的冲突中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between the Avengers and a group of mercenaries{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.59,0:19:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.49,0:19:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不幸遇难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Lagos, Nigeria, last month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些通常与世隔绝的瓦坎达人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The traditionally reclusive Wakandans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在袭击发生时 正在拉各斯进行公益服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were on an outreach mission in Lagos when the attack occurred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.84,0:19:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我国人民的鲜血洒在了外国领土上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our people's blood is spilled on foreign soil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不仅是因为犯罪行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only because of the actions of criminals,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还因为阻止犯罪的人的冷漠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but by the indifference of those pledge to stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.87,0:19:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,牺牲无辜者取得的胜利 根本算不上胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victory at the expense of the innocent, is no victory at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达国王接着…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Wakanda King went on to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.31,0:19:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不受国际法的限制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are operating outside and above the international law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们不回应此类行为 就会变成这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because that's the reality, if we don't respond to acts like these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旺达·马克西莫夫这样的能力增强者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What legal authority does an enhanced individual{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么法律权利在尼日利亚行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like Wanda Maximoff have to operate in Nige...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 都怪我 - 不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's my fault. - That's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.27,0:19:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就把电视再打开 他们可指名道姓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then turn the TV back on, they're being very specific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.99,0:19:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早该拆除那件炸弹背心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've clocked that bomb vest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而不是让你不得不动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}long before you have to deal with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:20:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朗姆洛提到"巴基"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rumlow said 'Bucky' and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,突然间 我又成了那个布鲁克林的16岁少年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of a sudden, I was a 16 year old kid again in Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And people died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这怪我 - 怪我们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's on me. - It's on both of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这份工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This job...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.45,0:20:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们尽可能救下更多的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We try to save as many people as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.37,0:20:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时并不能救每个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes that doesn't mean everybody,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我们无法接受这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, if we can't find a way to live with that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then next time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.49,0:20:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们谁都救不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe nobody get saved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小幻 我们谈过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vis, we talked about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 但门开着 所以我以为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. But the door was opened so I assumed that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗杰斯队长说斯塔克先生回来让我通知他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Rogers wished to know when Mr. Stark was arriving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.15,0:20:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 我马上下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. I'll be right down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我… 走门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll... use the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.16,0:20:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有 他带了位客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and apparently, he's brought a guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道是谁吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.59,0:20:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国务卿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Secretary of State.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.44,0:21:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五年前 我心脏病发作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}5 years ago, I had a heart attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打高尔夫球后挥杆时昏了过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and dropped right in the middle of my backswing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.64,0:21:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果 那成了我人生最大的幸事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turned out, it was the best round of my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为经历了13小时的手术和三重搭桥术之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because after 13 hours of surgery and a triple bypass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.14,0:21:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现了四十年军队生涯没教过我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found something 40 years in the army never taught me:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,远见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perspective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.69,0:21:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全世界欠复仇者联盟一个无法偿还的人情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world owes the Avengers an unpayable debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.78,0:21:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们为我们而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have... fought for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保护了我们 拿生命冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protected us. Risked your lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有很多人把你们当成英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But while a great many people see you as heroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.38,0:21:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但也有一些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are some...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.68,0:21:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更愿意用"义务警员"这个词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who would prefer the word "vigilantes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会用哪个词 国务卿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what word would you use, Mr. Secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"危险" 怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about "dangerous?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会如何形容一群驻扎在美国的能力增强者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you call a group of US-based, enhanced individuals,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,习惯性地无视主权国家边界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who routinely ignores sovereign borders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:22:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪 做什么 全凭自己意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and inflict their will wherever they choose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.52,0:22:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且老实说 对造成的后果也似乎毫不关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and who, frankly, seem unconcerned about what they leave behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.53,0:22:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.04,0:22:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,华盛顿特区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Washington D.C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.27,0:22:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,索科威亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sokovia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉各斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lagos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.51,0:23:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. That's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.35,0:23:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过去四年中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the past 4 years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.45,0:23:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的行动拥有无限权力而且无人监管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've operated with unlimited power and no supervision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.81,0:23:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界各国政府对这种情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's an arrangement the governments of the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已不能再容忍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can no longer tolerate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.61,0:23:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们有解决办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think we have a solution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.62,0:23:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《索科威亚协议》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Sokovia Accords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.54,0:23:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,117国批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approved by 117 countries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.53,0:23:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中写明 复仇者联盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It states, that the Avengers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.13,0:23:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不再是私人组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shall no longer be a private organization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.14,0:23:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.46,0:23:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要在一个联合国小组的监督下行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll operate under the supervision of a United Nations Panel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,且是否出动要由该小组决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only when and if that Panel deems it necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,复仇者联盟的成立是为了让世界更安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Avengers were formed to make the world a safer place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.82,0:23:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel we've done that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.61,0:23:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,队长 你知道托尔和班纳现在在哪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me Captain, do you know where Thor and Banner are right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.53,0:23:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要是搞丢了两个30兆吨级的核武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I misplaced a couple of 30 megaton nukes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.29,0:23:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定会有后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can bet there'd be consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.02,0:24:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妥协 保证 世界就是这样运转的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compromise. Reassurance. That's how the world works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.41,0:24:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 这就是中间立场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, this is the middle ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.42,0:24:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有应急预案的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, there are contingencies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.35,0:24:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三天后 联合国将在维也纳召开会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3 days from now, the UN meets in Vienna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.70,0:24:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,批准《协议》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to ratify the Accords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.39,0:24:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好好谈谈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, talk it over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们的决定你不喜欢呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we come to a decision you don't like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.30,0:24:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你们就退休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you retire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.93,0:24:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(克利夫兰)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.33,0:24:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.96,0:24:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外面停的是你的车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this your car out front?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.76,0:24:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开到人行道上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I jumped the kerb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.31,0:25:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以私了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we could, take care of it ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.31,0:25:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你想打电话叫警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, if you want to call the cops,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.55,0:25:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那也可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that... that's okay too, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.07,0:25:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.85,0:25:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用叫警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.43,0:25:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.74,0:25:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没怎么变样 上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kept your looks, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.34,0:26:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任务汇报 1991年12月16日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission report: December 16, 1991{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.69,0:26:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.08,0:26:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫泽莫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Zemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.23,0:26:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会重复一遍我的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will repeat my question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.95,0:26:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任务汇报 1991年12月16日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission report. December 16, 1991{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.23,0:26:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.65,0:26:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,神盾局陷落时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When S.H.I.E.L.D. fell,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.23,0:26:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑寡妇公布了九头蛇文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black Widow released Hydra files to the public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.68,0:26:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有数百万页 大都加了密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millions of pages much of it encrypted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.51,0:26:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很难破译\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not easy to decipher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.26,0:26:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.65,0:26:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.29,0:26:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也有耐心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.34,0:26:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有这两样就什么都能做成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man can do anything if he has those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.53,0:26:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.83,0:26:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任务汇报 1991年12月16日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission report. December 16, 1991{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.03,0:26:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九头蛇活该灰飞烟灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydra deserves its place on the ashheap,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.61,0:27:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 我不介意杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so your death would not bother me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.71,0:27:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不说 我就得用这本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'd have to use this book,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.93,0:27:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和其他更血腥的手段 来找到我要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and other bloodier methods to find what I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.56,0:27:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不想那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't look forward to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.20,0:27:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你的死 也只是保住了自尊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd only be dying for... your pride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.90,0:27:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九头蛇万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hail Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.70,0:27:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国务卿罗斯有一枚国会荣誉勋章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secretary Ross, has a Congressional Medal of Honor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.23,0:27:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比你多一枚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is one more than you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.79,0:27:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么假设我们同意签字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, let's say we agree to this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,政府过多久就会像追踪普通罪犯那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long does it gonna be before they LoJack us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.43,0:28:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,追踪我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a bunch of common criminals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.54,0:28:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,117个国家要签这份协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}117 countries want to sign this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.11,0:28:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,117个 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}117, Sam,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.46,0:28:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就完全不当回事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're just like, "No, that's cool. We got it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.62,0:28:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还要做多久两面派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long are you gonna play both sides?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.04,0:28:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我有个方程式 - 这样就明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have an equation. - Oh, this will clear it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.71,0:28:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克先生宣布他是钢铁侠后的八年里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the 8 years since Mr. Stark announced himself as Iron Man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.67,0:28:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能力增强者的数量一直呈指数增长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the number of known enhanced persons has grown exponentially.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.37,0:28:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同一段时期里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And during the same period,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.63,0:28:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能引发世界末日的事件数量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the number of potentially world-ending events{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.56,0:28:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也在同时上升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has risen at a commensurate rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.53,0:28:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说 这是我们的错吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saying it's our fault?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.22,0:28:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 这可能有因果关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying there maybe a causality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.64,0:28:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的超能力招来挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our very strength invites challenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.41,0:28:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挑战激发冲突\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Challenge incites conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.34,0:28:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而冲突\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And conflict...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.54,0:28:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会引发灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}breeds catastrophe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.13,0:28:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,监管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oversight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.88,0:28:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我们应该给予考虑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oversight is not an idea that can be dismissed out of hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.88,0:28:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说到点上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.31,0:28:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尼 你安静得出奇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, you're being uncharacteristically non-hyperverbal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.84,0:28:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他已经决定好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's because he's already made up his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.32,0:28:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐 你真懂我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, you know me so well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.41,0:29:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上 是电磁头痛犯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I'm nursing my electromagnetic headache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.69,0:29:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才沉默 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what's going on, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.78,0:29:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just pain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.63,0:29:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's discomfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.19,0:29:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁把咖啡渣倒进垃圾处理器了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's putting coffee grounds in the disposal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.98,0:29:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是给机车党开了家旅馆吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I running a bed and breakfast for a biker gang?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.91,0:29:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是查尔斯·斯宾塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's Charles Spencer by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.35,0:29:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个好孩子 计算机工程专业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a great kid. Computer engineering degree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.66,0:29:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,平均成绩3.6\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3.6 GPA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.77,0:29:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计划秋天去因特尔基层上班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had a floor-level gig at Intel planned for the fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.64,0:29:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 他想趁窝在办公室里之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first, he wanted to put a few miles on his soul,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.22,0:29:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先去积累阅历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before he park it behind a desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.90,0:29:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看世界 做做义工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See the world, maybe be of service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.36,0:29:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理不想去维加斯或劳德尔堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie didn't want to go to Vegas or Fort Lauderdale{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.22,0:29:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我就会选那些地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is what I would do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.01,0:29:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也没去巴黎或阿姆斯特丹 那儿多有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't go to Paris or Amsterdam, which sounds fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.25,0:29:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他想利用暑假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He decided to spend his summer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.17,0:29:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给穷人建生态住宅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}building sustainable housing for the poor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.72,0:29:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜是哪 索科威亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess where, Sokovia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.34,0:29:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可能是想做出些改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted to make a difference, I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.78,0:29:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们无从得知了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, we won't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.52,0:29:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们打得正高兴时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cause we dropped a building on him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.76,0:29:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向他身上砸了一栋楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while we were kicking ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.52,0:30:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们完全没有决策程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no decision making process here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.83,0:30:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要受到管制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to be put in check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.42,0:30:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管以什么形式 我都接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever form that takes, I'm game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.68,0:30:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不受限制 我们就会无法无天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can't accept limitations, if we're bounderless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.67,0:30:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比坏人好不到哪去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're no better than the bad guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.22,0:30:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尼 有人死在你眼皮下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, someone dies on your watch,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.23,0:30:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能就此放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you don't give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.85,0:30:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁说我们要放弃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who said we're giving up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.65,0:30:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不对自己的行为负责 就是放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are, for not taking responsibility for our actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.61,0:30:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些文件只是在推卸责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These documents just shifts the blames.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.09,0:30:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Steve, that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.32,0:30:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这话自负得危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is dangerously arrogant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.94,0:30:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是联合国啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the United Nations we're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.98,0:30:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是世界安全理事会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the World Security Council,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.56,0:30:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是神盾局 也不是九头蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not S.H.I.E.L.D., it's not Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.92,0:30:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 但管理者仍是人 人有目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but it's run by people with agendas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.94,0:30:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而目的会变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and agendas change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.72,0:30:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是好事 所以我才会在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good. That's why I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.71,0:30:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我意识到我的武器落入敌手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I realized what my weapons were capable of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.60,0:30:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后果会多不堪设想时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the wrong hands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.69,0:30:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就停止生产了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shut it down, stopped manufacturing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.35,0:30:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尼 那是你的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony. You chose to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.77,0:30:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们签字 就放弃了选择权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we sign this, we surrender our right to choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.66,0:30:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果小组派我们去不该去的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if this Panel sends us somewhere we don't think we should go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.02,0:30:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是不许我们去该去的地方呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if there's somewhere we need to go, and they don't let us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.01,0:31:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也许不完美 但仍是最可靠的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may not be perfect, but the safest hands are still our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.15,0:31:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果现在不签 将来他们会强迫我们签\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't do this now, it's going to be done to us later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.66,0:31:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实就是如此 到时会闹得很不好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the fact. That won't be pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.21,0:31:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是说他们会来抓我 - 我们会保护你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're saying they'll come for me. - We would protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.39,0:31:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许托尼是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Tony's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.27,0:31:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们稍作妥协 就还有回旋余地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If, we have one hand on the wheel we can still steer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.72,0:31:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果彻底决裂…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we take it off...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.24,0:31:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you the same woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.12,0:31:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几年前跟政府叫板的那个女人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who told the government to kiss her ass a few years ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.33,0:31:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这是… 审时度势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just... reading the terrain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.27,0:31:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在公众面前犯了些大错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have made some very public mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.74,0:31:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要重获他们的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to win their trust back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.19,0:31:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Focus up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.98,0:31:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 是我听错了吗 你是在支持我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, did I just mishear you or did you agree with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.72,0:31:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我想反悔了 - 不不 不能收回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, I want to take it back. - No, no, no. You can't retract it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.27,0:31:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢啊 真是破天荒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Unprecedented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.20,0:31:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 这事结了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, case close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.50,0:31:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(她在睡梦中去世了)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.77,0:31:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.04,0:31:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:32:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(伦敦)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.00,0:32:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(玛格丽特·佩吉·卡特)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.36,0:32:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.61,0:32:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想请莎伦·卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would like to invite Sharon Carter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.22,0:32:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上台说几句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to come up and say a few words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.30,0:32:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛格丽特·卡特为人熟知的身份是神盾局创始人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Margaret Carter was known to most as a founder of S.H.I.E.L.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.43,0:32:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但对我来说 她只是佩吉姑妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I just knew her as Aunt Peggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.83,0:32:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她办公室有张相片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had a photograph in her office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.99,0:32:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,佩吉姑妈跟肯尼迪并肩而站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt Peggy standing next to JFK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.10,0:33:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为孩子 这让我觉得很酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a kid, that was pretty cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.13,0:33:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这也是很大的压力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, it was a lot to live up to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.37,0:33:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我从不告诉别人我们是亲戚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why I never told anyone we were related.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.27,0:33:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一次我问她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked her once{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.36,0:33:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在女性饱受歧视的时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how she managed to master diplomacy and espionage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是如何成为一名成功的外交官和间谍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a time when no one wanted to see a woman succeed at either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.48,0:33:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她回答说 能妥协就妥协\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said, compromise where you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.23,0:33:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能妥协就坚持己见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But where you can't, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.24,0:33:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使你身边所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if everyone is telling you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.48,0:33:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都把错的说成对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that something wrong is something right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.04,0:33:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使全世界都叫你让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if the whole world is telling you to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.46,0:33:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须如大树般稳稳站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is your duty, to plant yourself like a tree,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.38,0:33:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直视他们的眼睛说 “不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}look them in they eye and say, "No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.24,0:33:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让开”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you move."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.42,0:33:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被解冻后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I came out of the ice,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.61,0:33:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我认识的人都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought everyone I had known was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.71,0:34:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来知道她还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I found out that she was alive,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.87,0:34:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只觉得还有她在很幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just lucky to have her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.07,0:34:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有你也是她的幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had you back too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.15,0:34:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁签字了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who else signed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.10,0:34:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尼 罗德 幻视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, Rhodey, Vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.00,0:34:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克林特呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clint?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.80,0:34:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说自己退休了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Says he's retired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.37,0:34:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 旺达呢 - 待定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wanda? - TBD.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.81,0:34:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去维也纳签《协议》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm off to Vienna for the signing of the Accords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.70,0:34:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞机上还有好多空位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's plenty of room on the jet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.26,0:34:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这虽然是最轻松的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just because it's the path of least resistance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.12,0:34:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不代表就是错的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't mean it's the wrong path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.43,0:34:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,团结比团结的方式更重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Staying together is more important than how we stay together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.51,0:34:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们要为此放弃什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we giving up to do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.86,0:34:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 小娜 我不能签\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Nat. I can't sign it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.27,0:34:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.80,0:34:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你来干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.10,0:34:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让你一个人面对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want you to be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.07,0:35:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.31,0:35:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(维也纳)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.67,0:35:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在一次特殊的联合国会议中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At a special United Nations conference,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.71,0:35:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,117个国家一起正式签署了《索科威亚协议》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}117 countries have come together to ratify the Sokovia Accords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.29,0:35:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抱歉 请问是罗曼诺夫小姐吗 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me, Miss Romanoff? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.96,0:35:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要您签个字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These need your signature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.20,0:35:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.53,0:35:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩似乎都不习惯成为焦点人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose neither of us is used to the spotlight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.13,0:35:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟这不总是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not always so flattering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.34,0:35:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到目前表现得还好嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to be doing alright so far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.36,0:35:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到你之前在国会山的经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Considering your last trip to Capitol Hill,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.69,0:35:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想必你跟这些人待在一起不会很自在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't think you'd be particularly comfortable in this company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.22,0:35:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确实如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.64,0:35:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光是这一点就让我感激你能来 罗曼诺夫小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that alone makes me glad you are here, Ms Romanoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.65,0:35:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 你不赞成此举吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? You don't approve of all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.18,0:35:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那《协议》我支持 政治方面就不敢苟同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Accords, yes. The politics, not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.24,0:36:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两个人在一间屋里 效率能胜过百人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two people, in a room, can get more done than a 100.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.83,0:36:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你需要搬钢琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you need to move a piano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.61,0:36:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 父亲 - 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Papa. - Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.80,0:36:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 罗曼诺夫小姐 - 特查卡国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Miss. Romanoff. - King T'Chaka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.53,0:36:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请允许我为尼日利亚的事道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, allow me to apologize for what happened in Nigeria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.11,0:36:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.84,0:36:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你对我们的支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for agreeing to all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.22,0:36:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾罗杰斯队长今天将缺席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sad to hear that Captain Rogers will not be joining us today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.93,0:36:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我也很遗憾 - 请大家就座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, so am I. - If everyone could please be seated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.31,0:36:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会议现在正式开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This assembly is now in session.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.29,0:36:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,未来在召唤我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the future calling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.46,0:36:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.00,0:36:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.99,0:36:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不喜欢外交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a man who disapproves of diplomacy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.20,0:36:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却做得越来越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're getting quite good at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.65,0:36:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就好 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm happy, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.34,0:36:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.23,0:36:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.00,0:36:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当失窃的瓦坎达振金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When stolen Wakandan vibranium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.62,0:36:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被用于制造可怕的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was used to make a terrible weapon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.45,0:36:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们瓦坎达人被迫质疑我们的遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we, in Wakanda, were force to question our legacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.97,0:37:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在尼日利亚遇害的那些男男女女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those men and women killed in Nigeria,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.38,0:37:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是前去开展慈善活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were part of a good will mission{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.32,0:37:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而他们的祖国已在阴影中待了太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from a country too long in the shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然而 我们不会因不幸而却步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will not, however, let misfortune drive us back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.10,0:37:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会努力让我们想走入的世界更加美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will fight to improve the world we wish to join.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.28,0:37:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常感激复仇者联盟对此计划的支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am grateful to the Avengers for supporting this initiative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.19,0:37:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达非常骄傲能为和平贡献力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wakanda is proud to extend its hand in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.21,0:37:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家卧倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.69,0:38:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈曾劝我不要入伍 但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mom tried to talk me out of enlisting, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.50,0:38:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但佩吉姑妈没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not Aunt Peggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.97,0:38:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的第一个大腿枪套就是她送的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She brought me my first thigh holster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.70,0:38:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 非常实用 - 还很时髦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Very practical. - And stylish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.60,0:38:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中情局把你派来了这里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The CIA has you stationed over here now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.80,0:38:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是去柏林 联合反恐任务小组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At Berlin, Joint Terrorism Task Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.04,0:38:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.51,0:38:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 听起来不错 - 可不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sounds fun. - I know, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.74,0:38:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been meaning to ask you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.22,0:38:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在走廊对面监视我的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you were spying on me from across the hall...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.10,0:38:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我在执行任务的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean when I was doing my job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.77,0:38:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,佩吉知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Peggy know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.40,0:38:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的秘密已经够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She kept so many secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.21,0:38:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望她还要面对你的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want her to have one from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.22,0:38:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢你送我回来 - 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for walking me back. - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.35,0:39:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史蒂夫 你得看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve. There's something you got to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.92,0:39:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一枚放在新闻车上的炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bomb hidden in a news van{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.91,0:39:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 炸毁了位于维也纳的联合国大楼 - 是谁在指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ripped through the UN building in Vienna. - Who's coordinating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.00,0:39:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很好 他们很可靠 鉴证呢 - 超过70人受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good. They're solid. Forensics? - More than 70 people have been injured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.23,0:39:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少12人死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least 12 are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.33,0:39:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.60,0:39:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中包括瓦坎达国王特查卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including Wakanda's King T'Chaka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.14,0:39:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当局发布了一段嫌疑人的视频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officials have released a video of a suspect,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.23,0:39:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们确认此人正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who they have identified{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.38,0:39:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冬日战士詹姆斯·布坎南·巴恩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as James Buchanan Barnes, the Winter Soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.28,0:39:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这名臭名昭著的九头蛇特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The infamous Hydra agent,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.83,0:39:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与数起恐怖袭击和政治暗杀有牵连\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}linked to numerous acts of terrorism and political assassinations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.25,0:39:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得去工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.78,0:39:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给军情六处打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call MI6{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.80,0:39:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看能否让微取证小组快速行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}see if we can get Micro Forensics to hurry this up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.78,0:39:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两小时内得赶过来 不然就没意义了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need the whole team here in two hours or it's not worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.83,0:39:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.77,0:39:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我的文化里 死亡并不是终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my culture, death, is not the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.20,0:40:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更像是 前往陌生领域的起点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's more of a... stepping-off point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.43,0:40:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你向芭丝特与塞赫麦特伸出双手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You reach out with both hands and Bast and Sekhmet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.16,0:40:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们带你走进绿草原 在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they lead you into the green veldt where...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.97,0:40:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以永远奔跑下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can run forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.10,0:40:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来非常安宁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds very peaceful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.10,0:40:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲也这样认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father thought so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.93,0:40:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不是我的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.37,0:40:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特查拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T'Challa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.09,0:40:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特遣队会决定谁去抓巴恩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Task Force will decide who brings in Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.85,0:40:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用麻烦了 罗曼诺夫小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother, Miss. Romanoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.94,0:40:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会亲手杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill him myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.51,0:40:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂 - 你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Are you alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.16,0:40:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还行 谢谢关心 我挺幸运的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, yeah, thanks. I... I got lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.11,0:40:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你多在乎巴恩斯 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how much Barnes means to you. I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.77,0:40:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待在家里 别出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.79,0:41:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只会让局面更糟 让我们都不好做 求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll only make this worse for all of us. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.72,0:41:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是说你要逮捕我吗 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you saying you'll arrest me? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.64,0:41:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你出手 会有人抓你的 现在就是这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone will, if you interfere. That's how it works now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.94,0:41:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是他都变成这样了 小娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he's this far gone, Nat,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.97,0:41:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就该由我去抓他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be the one to bring him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.27,0:41:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.26,0:41:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是最不可能因此丧命的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm the one least likely to die trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.33,0:41:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.58,0:41:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她叫你别插手吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She tell you to stay out of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.19,0:41:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她或许有些道理 - 他也会为我出手的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Might have a point. - He'd do it for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.68,0:41:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要在1945年 有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1945, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.15,0:41:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想确认我们考虑周全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to make sure we consider all our options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.22,0:41:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲你开枪的人 通常最终也会冲我开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people that shoot at you, usually wind up shooting at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.86,0:41:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,录像公布后收到了很多线报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tips have been pouring in since that footage went public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.63,0:41:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人人都觉得冬日战士跟他们去一家健身房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody thinks the Winter Soldier goes to their gym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.10,0:41:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大部分线索都没有价值 除了这一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of it is noise, except for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.10,0:41:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的上司现在就要简报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My boss expects a briefing pretty much now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.43,0:41:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能给你这么多情报了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that's all the answer you're gonna get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.88,0:41:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 你得抓紧时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - And you're going to have to hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.12,0:42:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的命令是当场击毙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have orders to shoot on sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.91,0:42:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回祖国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Homecoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.94,0:42:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.56,0:42:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.24,0:42:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火车货车车厢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freight car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.73,0:42:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穆勒先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Muller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.82,0:42:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您的早餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have your breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.70,0:42:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,隔着门就闻到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could smell it before I opened the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.07,0:42:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,熏猪肋肉和黑咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Side of bacon and black coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.02,0:42:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是老样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.58,0:42:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果您需要 我可以做点儿别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can make you something different, if you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.72,0:42:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is wonderful...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.20,0:42:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮您端到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will just put this on your...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.82,0:42:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 我自己来就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, I can manage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.07,0:43:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,- 这个怎么样 - 很好的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.82,0:43:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,那好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.94,0:43:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,那我要六个
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.96,0:43:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,给你 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.88,0:43:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(布加勒斯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.04,0:43:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(冬日战士因维也纳爆炸事件被通缉)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.87,0:44:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.94,0:44:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德国特种部队从南面过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}German special forces approaching from the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.11,0:44:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.34,0:44:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认得我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.36,0:44:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.56,0:44:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在博物馆里了解过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read about you in a museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.84,0:44:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们设置了警戒线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've set the perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.23,0:44:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你有点紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.06,0:44:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也有理由紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have plenty of reason to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.33,0:44:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你在撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.88,0:45:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没去维也纳 我不做那种事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't in Vienna. I don't do that anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.89,0:45:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们进入大楼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're entering the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.28,0:45:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,认为是你的人要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the people who think you did are coming here now.{\r}
