Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.23,0:45:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不非得打起来 巴基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't have end in a fight, Buck.{\r}
