Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.80,0:45:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从河里救我出来 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pulled me from the river. Why?{\r}
