Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.92,0:45:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.56,0:45:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,突破 突破 突破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breach! Breach! Breach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.09,0:45:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,把门炸开
