Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.68,0:46:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他顺东楼梯井下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's headed down the east stairwell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.92,0:47:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.69,0:48:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 山姆 去西南屋顶 - 另一个人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam, southwest rooftop. - Who the hell is the other guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.37,0:48:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.48,0:48:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 山姆 - 我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam. - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.00,0:49:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down!{\r}
