Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.08,0:49:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 我甩不掉这人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, I can't shake this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.50,0:49:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.88,0:51:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.18,0:51:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你 队长 你是罪犯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, Cap. You're a criminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.73,0:51:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.09,0:52:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放少许辣椒粉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pinch of paprika.{\r}
