Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.24,0:52:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是辣椒粉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that paprikash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.12,0:52:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这或许能让你振奋精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it might... lift your spirits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.01,0:52:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,精神振奋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spirits lifted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.50,0:52:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 我从来没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my defense, I... I haven't actually ever...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.46,0:52:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没吃过东西 - 能让我来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- eaten anything before, so... - May I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.86,0:52:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.77,0:52:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旺达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.65,0:52:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人讨厌你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one dislikes you, Wanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.90,0:52:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - Oh, you're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.62,0:52:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.95,0:53:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是杏仁体的一种下意识反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}involuntary response in their amygdala{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.29,0:53:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们控制不住害怕你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they can't help but be afraid of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.59,0:53:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也怕我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.89,0:53:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的杏仁体是人造的 所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My amygdala is synthetic, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.17,0:53:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前对自己有一定的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to think of myself one way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.22,0:53:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 自从有了异能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, after this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.53,0:53:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.80,0:53:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是那个我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still me, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.88,0:53:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但世人不这么看了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... that's not what everyone else sees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.23,0:53:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know, I don't know what this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.62,0:53:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.07,0:53:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它不属于这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it's not of this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.72,0:53:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它给洛基的权杖供能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it powered Loki staff,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.13,0:53:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也让你拥有了异能 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gave you your abilities. But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.07,0:53:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的真正属性依然未知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}its true nature is a mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.61,0:53:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而它是我的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet, it is part of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.63,0:53:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怕它吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you afraid of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.33,0:53:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想了解它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish to understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.09,0:53:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我越了解它 它对我的控制就越小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more I do, the less it controls me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.30,0:53:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许有天 我还能控制它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day, who knows, I may even control it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.43,0:54:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这是什么 但肯定不是辣椒粉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what's in this but it is not paprika.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.25,0:54:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去趟商店 20分钟就回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go to the store, I'll be back in 20 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.96,0:54:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者 我们可以订披萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alternatively, we could order a pizza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.40,0:54:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幻视 你是不让我离开吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vision, are you not letting me leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.39,0:54:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是为了安全起见 - 我能保护自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It is a question of safety. - I can protect myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.32,0:54:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.37,0:54:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克先生想避免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark would like to avoid the possibility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.88,0:54:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再发生公开事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of another public incident,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.34,0:54:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到《协议》基本尘埃落定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until the Accords are of a... more secured foundation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.88,0:54:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.92,0:54:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世人像我那样看待你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For people to see you... as I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.82,0:54:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(柏林)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.00,0:55:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那么 你喜欢猫吗 - 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, you like cats? - Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.86,0:55:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么 这家伙穿得像个猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Dude shows up dressed like a cat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.30,0:55:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不好奇吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you don't wanna know more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.81,0:55:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的衣服 是振金做的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your suit. It's Vibranium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.09,0:55:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹世代是瓦坎达的守护者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Panther has been the protector of Wakanda for generations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.32,0:55:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是战士代代相传的衣钵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mantle passed from warrior to warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.35,0:55:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 因为你朋友杀了我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now because your friend murdered my father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.25,0:55:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也继承了国王的衣钵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also wear the Mantle of King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.37,0:55:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒要问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I ask you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.00,0:55:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既作为战士 又是国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as both warrior and King,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.05,0:56:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你还能保护你朋友多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how long do you think you can keep your friend safe from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.98,0:56:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么处置他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's gonna happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.76,0:56:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按说你们也该跟他一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same thing that ought to happen to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.05,0:56:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进行心理评估 然后引渡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psychological evaluation and extradition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.79,0:56:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是埃弗雷特·罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Everett Ross,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.75,0:56:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特遣队副指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deputy Task Force Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.51,0:56:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那律师呢 - 律师 真可笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about a lawyer. - Lawyer, that's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.29,0:56:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们的武器锁好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See their weapons are placed in lock up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.52,0:56:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会给你写收据的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we'll write you a receipt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.58,0:56:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好别让我看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I better not look out the window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.71,0:56:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人穿着我的装备在飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and see anybody flying around in that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.93,0:56:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会为您提供办公室 不会让您进牢房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be provided with an office instead of a cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.19,0:56:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托您留在办公室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do me a favour, stay in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.76,0:56:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哪也不打算去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't intend on going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.83,0:56:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说一句 这就是更糟的局面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the record. This is what making things worse looks like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.03,0:56:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.91,0:56:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.04,0:57:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗马尼亚不受《协议》保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romania was not Accords-sanctioned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.32,0:57:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗德中校在监督善后工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Rhodes is supervising clean up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.09,0:57:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们处理问题期间别再惹麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try not to break anything while we fix this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.56,0:57:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问责吗 当然要问责了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consequences? You bet there'll be consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.93,0:57:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当然可以引用我刚刚说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously you can quote me on that cause I just said it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.99,0:57:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有事吗 谢谢你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything else? Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.52,0:57:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consequences?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.77,0:57:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国务卿罗斯想起诉你们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secretary Ross wants you both prosecuted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.16,0:57:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总得拿点什么堵他的嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had to give him something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.49,0:57:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿不回盾牌了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not getting that shield back, am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.69,0:57:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,严格说 那是政府财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically, it's the government's property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.78,0:57:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 鹰翼也是 - 太冷酷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wings too. - That's cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.54,0:57:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总比监狱温暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warmer than jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.70,0:57:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,不会吧 搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.72,0:57:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想看点厉害的东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you want to see something cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.62,0:57:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从老爸的档案馆里找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pulled something from dad's archives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.48,0:58:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉时机正合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felt timely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.03,0:58:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯福1941年签《租借法案》时用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}FDR signed the Lend-Lease bill with these in 1941.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.94,0:58:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为急需帮助的盟军提供了支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Provided support to the Allies when they needed it most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.99,0:58:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人会说这让我们国家靠近了战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone would say it brought our country closer to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.90,0:58:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是因为这对笔 你就不会在这儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, if not for these, you wouldn't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.87,0:58:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是想 该怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to, what do you call it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.56,0:58:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是橄榄枝 是这么说的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's an olive branch. Is that what you call it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.32,0:58:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,派珀来了吗 我没见着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Pepper here? I didn't see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.93,0:58:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们算是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are... kinda...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.84,0:58:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 其实就是 - 有喜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- well not kinda... - Pregnant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.97,0:58:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 绝对没有 我们分手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, definitely not. We're taking a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.93,0:58:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁都没有错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nobody's fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.72,0:58:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 托尼 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry, Tony. I didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.90,0:58:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几年前我差点失去她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few years ago, I almost lost her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.04,0:58:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是我毁了我所有的战甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I trashed all my suits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.70,0:58:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们不得不对付九头蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, we had to mop up Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.56,0:58:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后又是奥创 这怪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then Ultron, my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.23,0:58:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后事情一件又一件 我一直没停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, and then, and then. I never stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.62,0:59:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为事实就是我不想停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause the truth is I don't wanna stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.53,0:59:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想失去她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to lose her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.69,0:59:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想或许《协议》是个折衷的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought maybe the Accords could split the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.94,0:59:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,替她说一句 我很难搞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In her defense, I'm a handful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.29,0:59:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我爸也不让人省心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet, dad was a pain in the ass, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.78,0:59:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可他和我妈却很美满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he and mom always made it work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.69,0:59:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴霍华德结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm glad Howard got married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.95,0:59:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只见过年轻单身的他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only knew him when he was young and single.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.05,0:59:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 你们认识啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh really? You two knew each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.23,0:59:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从没提过 可能就提过一千次吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never mentioned that. Maybe only a thousand times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.97,0:59:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 我以前真恨你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I hated you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.23,0:59:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是有意让你为难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mean to make things difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.80,0:59:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 因为你是个非常有礼貌的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. Because you're a very polite person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.94,0:59:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我觉得情况不妙 我没法无视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I see a situation pointed south, I can't ignore it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.95,0:59:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有时我希望我能 - 你才不呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sometimes I wish I could. - No, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.39,0:59:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.83,0:59:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.56,0:59:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时我真想一拳揍在你完美的牙上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I wanna punch you in your perfect teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.42,0:59:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不希望你离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't wanna see you gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.66,0:59:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.85,1:00:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还没出什么不可挽回的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So far nothing's happened that can't be undone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.42,1:00:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你签字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.75,1:00:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以把这24小时的行动合法化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can make the last 24 hours legit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.84,1:00:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴恩斯会被转移到一家美国精神病中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barnes gets transferred to an American psych center{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.77,1:00:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而不是瓦坎达监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instead of a Wakandan prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.13,1:00:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不是绝对不行 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not saying it's impossible. But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.78,1:00:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得有保障措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there would have to be safeguards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.37,1:00:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.97,1:00:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等公关处理好了 这些文件都可以修订\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we put out the PR fire, these documents can be amended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.93,1:00:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经提议让你和旺达复职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I filed a motion to have you and Wanda reinstated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.70,1:00:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 旺达 旺达怎么了 - 她很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wanda? What about Wanda? - She's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.57,1:00:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她现在被禁足在基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's confined to the compound currently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.28,1:00:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幻视在陪着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vision's keeping her company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.40,1:00:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 托尼 总是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, Tony! Every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.40,1:00:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每次我以为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time I think you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.53,1:00:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 明理 - 怎么了 100英亩的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- see things the right way... - What? It's a 100 acres{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.79,1:00:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还带小泳池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a lap pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.84,1:00:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放映室 这样保护人已经很好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got a screening room. There's worse ways to protect people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.44,1:00:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保护 你是这么觉得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protection? Is that how you see this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.07,1:00:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是保护吗 这是拘禁 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is protection? It's internment, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.00,1:00:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不是美国公民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not a US citizen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.96,1:00:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托 托尼 - 他们可不会给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, come on, Tony. - And they don't grant visas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.01,1:00:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大规模杀伤性武器批签证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Weapons of Mass Destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.30,1:00:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她还是个孩子 - 饶了我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's a kid! - Give me a break!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.57,1:00:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing what has to be done{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.31,1:01:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才能避免我们更糟的处境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to stave off something worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.05,1:01:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就继续自欺欺人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep telling yourself that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.11,1:01:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一对儿的别分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hate to break up the set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.77,1:01:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 巴恩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Mr. Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.58,1:01:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是受联合国指派来评估你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been sent by the United Nations to evaluate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.67,1:01:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能坐下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind if I sit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.99,1:01:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的名字是詹姆斯吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your first name is James?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.85,1:01:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你装备的收据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The receipt for your gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.06,1:01:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸟服装 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bird costume? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.37,1:01:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't write it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.36,1:01:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(保密)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.60,1:01:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来指责你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not here to judge you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.59,1:01:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想问你几个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to ask you a few questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.80,1:01:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你在哪里吗 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know where you are, James?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.36,1:01:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不跟我说话 我就没法帮你 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't help you if you don't talk to me, James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.88,1:02:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫巴基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Bucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.51,1:02:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.15,1:02:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,我来送个大家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.67,1:02:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.13,1:02:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给 就在这儿签\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Just sign here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.25,1:02:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这里吗 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.72,1:02:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特遣队为什么要公布这张照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would the task force release this photo to begin with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.72,1:02:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把消息传出去 让更多人来找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the word out, involve as many eyes as we can?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.64,1:02:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.38,1:02:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是逼的人没法藏身的好方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good way to flush a guy out of hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.14,1:02:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,引爆炸弹 被人拍到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set off a bomb, get your picture taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.10,1:02:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让七百万人寻找冬日战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get 7 billion people looking for the Winter soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.17,1:02:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说有人为找他而陷害他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying someone framed him to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.28,1:02:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史蒂夫 我们找了他两年都一无所获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve, we looked for the guy for 2 years and found nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.88,1:03:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没炸联合国 这可非常引人注目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't bomb the UN. That turns a lot of heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.84,1:03:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 但这不能保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. But that doesn't guarantee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.91,1:03:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陷害他的人能找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that whoever framed him would get him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.51,1:03:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能保证我们会找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it guarantees that we would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.77,1:03:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.32,1:03:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 巴基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me Bucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.20,1:03:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你目睹了很多事 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've seen a great deal, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.95,1:03:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.46,1:03:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You feel that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.73,1:03:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一旦开口 恐怖就无法停止了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you open your mouth, the horrors might never stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.98,1:03:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.35,1:03:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(包裹已送达)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.90,1:03:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只谈一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only have to talk about one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.28,1:03:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.83,1:04:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧的 各位 让我看到巴恩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright. Come on, guys. Get me eyes on Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.85,1:04:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.00,1:04:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,星期五 能查到电力中断的源头吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}F.R.I.D.A.Y. Can you get me a source on that outage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.43,1:04:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,东地下5层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sub-level 5, east wing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.86,1:04:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么回事 - 我们来谈谈你的家乡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell is this? - Why don't we discuss your home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.18,1:04:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是罗马尼亚 也不是布鲁克林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not Romania. Certainly not Brooklyn, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.44,1:04:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 你真正的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, your real home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.63,1:04:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,渴望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Longing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.63,1:04:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.80,1:04:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生锈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rusted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.23,1:04:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.44,1:04:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,十七\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seventeen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.82,1:04:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.07,1:04:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黎明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daybreak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.48,1:04:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火炉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Furnace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.09,1:04:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.05,1:05:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,善良\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Benign{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.59,1:05:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回祖国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Homecoming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.02,1:05:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.41,1:05:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火车货车车厢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freight car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.92,1:05:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soldier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.06,1:05:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿意服从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to comply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.64,1:05:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任务汇报 1991年12月16日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission report. December 16, 1991{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.50,1:05:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.47,1:05:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.87,1:05:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.96,1:06:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁 你想干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you? What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.41,1:06:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毁灭一个帝国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To see an empire fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.31,1:06:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,疏散所有民众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evac all civilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.51,1:06:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在大楼周围拉起警戒 派出武装直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me a perimeter around the building and gunships in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.90,1:06:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带西装（战衣）了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please tell me you brought a suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.30,1:06:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然带了 汤姆·福特的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure did. It's a lovely Tom Ford,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.92,1:06:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三件套 两扣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three-Piece, 2 button...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.15,1:06:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在是现役非战斗人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a active duty, non combatant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.47,1:06:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.86,1:07:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就位了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.35,1:07:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你至少还认得我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could at least recognise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.13,1:08:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.84,1:10:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他又问了我一次 你会不会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He asked me again if you're going to be there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.69,1:10:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I wasn't sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.23,1:10:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真该看到他那张小脸 尽量赶回来 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've seen his little face. Just try, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.69,1:10:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要睡了 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to bed. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.21,1:10:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维也纳联合国爆炸案的嫌疑人詹姆斯·巴恩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Barnes the suspect in the UN Vienna bombing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.90,1:10:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今日脱逃羁押\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}escaped custody today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.12,1:10:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同时失踪的还有复仇者史蒂夫·罗杰斯队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also missing Avenger Captain Steve Rogers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.34,1:10:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和山姆·威尔逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Sam Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.67,1:10:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(莫斯科)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.83,1:11:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Cap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.64,1:11:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.81,1:11:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是哪一个巴基在说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which Bucky am I talking to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.60,1:11:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈的名字叫萨拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mom's name is Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.86,1:11:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以前会往鞋里垫报纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You used to wear newspapers in your shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.62,1:11:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博物馆里可不会讲这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't read that in a museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.56,1:11:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就行了 就没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like that, we're suppose to be cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.24,1:11:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我做了什么 - 不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did I do? - Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.11,1:11:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 我就知道会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh god, I knew this would happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.29,1:11:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九头蛇给我灌输的东西都还在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything Hydra put inside me is still there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.96,1:11:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只要说几个词就能激发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All he had to do was say the god damn words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.71,1:11:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他是谁 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who was he? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.50,1:11:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那场陷害你的爆炸 害死了很多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are dead. The bombing. The set up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.95,1:11:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个医生大费周章 就为跟你待上10分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doctor did all that just to get 10 minutes with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.06,1:12:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能只说句:"我不知道"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to do better than "I don't know."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.53,1:12:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他想知道西伯利亚的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted to know about Siberia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.35,1:12:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被关押的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where I was kept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.97,1:12:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他想知道具体位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted to know exactly where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.67,1:12:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么要知道这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would he need to know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.00,1:12:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为冬日战士不止我一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm not the only Winter Soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.60,1:13:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.72,1:14:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.10,1:14:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们是谁 - 精英敢死队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who were they? - Their most elite death squad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.41,1:14:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九头蛇史上杀人数最多的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More kills than anyone in Hydra history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.71,1:14:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那还是在注射血清之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that was before the serum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.84,1:14:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都变得跟你一样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They all turned out like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.24,1:14:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.00,1:14:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个医生能控制他们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doctor, can he control them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.80,1:14:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,八九不离十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.34,1:14:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说他想毁灭一个帝国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said he wanted to see an empire fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.83,1:14:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有那些人的帮助 他就做得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With these guys he could do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.47,1:14:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会30种语言 来去不着痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They speak 30 languages, can hide in plain sight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.25,1:14:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,渗透 暗杀 颠覆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}infiltrate, assassinate, destabilize,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.70,1:14:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们能在一夜之间毁灭一个国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they can take a whole country down in one night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.88,1:14:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打得你措手不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd never see them coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.88,1:14:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搁在一周前这事会简单得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This would've been a lot easier a week ago.{\r}
