Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.66,1:25:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的资源很可观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My resources are considerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.50,1:25:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 世界花了70年时间才找到巴恩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it took the world 70 years to find Barnes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.87,1:25:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你大概花一半时间就能做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you could probably do that in about half the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.65,1:25:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.43,1:25:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识一个知道的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know someone who does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.06,1:25:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你恐怕不太明白什么叫逃跑车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure you understand the concept of a get-away car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.03,1:25:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这车低调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's low profile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.57,1:25:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 这些东西可是很招眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, 'cause this stuff tends to draw a crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.17,1:25:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能把座椅往前点吗 - 不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you move your seat up? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.27,1:25:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又欠你个人情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.96,1:25:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keeping a list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.58,1:25:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他之前可企图杀我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, he kind of tried to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.29,1:25:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 那个我也会记着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I'll put it on the list, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.29,1:26:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会来找你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna come looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.97,1:26:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.45,1:26:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 莎伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.46,1:26:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这真是 - 早该了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was... - Late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.70,1:26:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.10,1:26:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我该走了 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I should go. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.80,1:26:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.49,1:27:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不是别无选择也不会找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I wouldn't have called If I had any other choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.14,1:27:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是帮我忙呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey man, you're doing me a favour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.81,1:27:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说 我还要还债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides... I owed a debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.42,1:27:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 多谢支持我 - 我该行动起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for having my back. - It was time to get off my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.35,1:27:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个新人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about our other recruit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.07,1:27:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他迫不及待呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's raring to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.36,1:27:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给了他点咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had to put a little coffee in him... but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.11,1:27:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他应该没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he should be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.26,1:27:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是哪个时区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What timezone is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.24,1:27:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧 去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.99,1:27:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 美国队长 - 朗先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain America. - Mr. Lang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.30,1:27:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是荣幸 我握得太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an honor. I'm shaking your hand too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.84,1:27:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这太赞了 美国队长啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is awesome. Captain America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.09,1:27:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你我也认识 你好棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you too, you're great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.14,1:27:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.88,1:27:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I wanted to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.11,1:27:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你认识很多厉害人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you know a lot of super people, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.31,1:27:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢想到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for thinking of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.24,1:27:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 伙计 - 好啊 小豆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, man. - What's up tic-tac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.73,1:27:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你很高兴 那个 上次的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you. Look. Look, what happened last time when I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.80,1:27:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是场很棒的面试 但绝不会再有下次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a great audition, but it'll... it'll never happen again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.47,1:27:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们告诉你我们要对付什么了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They tell you what we're up against?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.75,1:28:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是几个疯子刺客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something about some... psycho assassins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.29,1:28:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次我们的行动不合法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're outside the law on this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.51,1:28:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你跟我们来 就是通缉犯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if you come with us, you're a wanted man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.07,1:28:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早习惯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, what else is new?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.47,1:28:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们该走了 - 有架直升机等着我们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We should get moving. - We got a chopper lined up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.42,1:28:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在疏散机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're evacuating the airport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.24,1:28:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 斯塔克 - 斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stark. - Stark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.89,1:28:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suit up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.12,1:28:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在机场总能碰到熟人 真是怪啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so weird how you run into people at the airport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.82,1:28:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说是不是 - 非常怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't you think that's weird? - Definitely weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.76,1:28:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear me out, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.03,1:28:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个精神病医生 他才是幕后黑手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doctor, the psychiatrist, he's behind all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.75,1:29:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 队长 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain. - Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.54,1:29:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.76,1:29:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯给了我36小时带你回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ross gave me 36 hours to bring you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.08,1:29:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经过了24小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was 24 hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.91,1:29:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 帮兄弟一把啊 - 你抓错人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you help a brother out? - You're after the wrong guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.32,1:29:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的判断力有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your judgment is askew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.29,1:29:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的老战友昨天杀了很多无辜者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your old war buddy killed innocent people yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.94,1:29:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有5个跟他一样的超级战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there are 5 more super soldiers just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.40,1:29:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让那个医生先找到他们 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't let the doctor find them first, Tony. I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.70,1:29:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.68,1:29:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道接下来会怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, what's about to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.33,1:29:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这次也要打出一条血路吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really want to punch your way out of this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.76,1:29:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我没耐心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I've run out of patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.86,1:29:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,内衣宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Underoos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.27,1:29:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得好 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice job, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.98,1:29:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 落地不太理想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. Well, I could've stuck the landing a little better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.01,1:29:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新服装… 不太适应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's... just the new suit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.18,1:29:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 这不是事儿 斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, it's nothing, Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.45,1:29:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,服装很完美 谢谢您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's-It's perfect, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.58,1:29:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我们不用开始闲扯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we don't really need to start a conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.37,1:29:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Cap... Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.28,1:29:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是蜘蛛侠 你的大粉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big fan, I'm Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.37,1:29:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行了 回头再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we'll talk about it later. Just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.23,1:29:54.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大家好 - 干得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, everyone. - good job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.31,1:29:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没闲着啊 - 你好傻啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've been busy. - And you've been a complete idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.33,1:29:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把克林特扯进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragging in Clint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.24,1:30:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把旺达从她不想离开的地方救出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rescuing Wanda from a place she doesn't even want to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.50,1:30:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个安全的地方 我在努力…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A safe place. I'm trying to keep....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.80,1:30:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力阻止你分裂复仇者联盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to keep you from tearing the Avengers apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.24,1:30:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你签字时就已经分裂我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did that when you signed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.69,1:30:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, we're done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.35,1:30:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交出巴恩斯 跟我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna turn Barnes over and you're gonna come with us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.55,1:30:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上照做 否则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now, because it's us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.70,1:30:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一支联合特别行动司令部的分队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or a squad of J-SOC guys...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.84,1:30:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会来抓你们 他们下手不会留情的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with no compunction about being impolite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.83,1:30:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.20,1:30:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.99,1:30:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昆式战斗机在北跑道的5号机库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The quinjet's in hanger five, north runway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.51,1:30:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行动 朗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, Lang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.66,1:30:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 有什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys. Something...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.62,1:30:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What-What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.16,1:30:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的吧 美国队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe this is yours, Captain America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.07,1:30:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可好 好了 停车场有俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great. Alright, there's two on the parking deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.59,1:30:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中一个是马克西莫夫 我去抓她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them is Maximoff, I'm gonna grab her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.70,1:30:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗德 你应付队长啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rhodey, you want to take Cap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.89,1:30:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,候机大厅有俩 威尔逊和巴恩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got two in the terminal. Wilson and Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.13,1:30:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴恩斯是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barnes is mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.50,1:30:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克先生 我该做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mr. Stark, what should I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.94,1:30:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是说好了吗 别靠太近 用网缠住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we discussed. Keep your distance. Web them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.92,1:30:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, copy that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.16,1:31:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让开 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.81,1:31:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会说第二遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't ask a second time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.93,1:31:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我真的不想伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I really don't want to hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.96,1:31:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不必担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't stress about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.52,1:31:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是什么鬼 - 这年头谁都有点花招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell was that? - Everyone's got a gimmick now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.88,1:31:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有金属臂 太牛逼了 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a metal arm? That is awesome, dude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.29,1:31:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有权保持沉默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the right to remain silent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.72,1:31:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不住了 队长 虽然不致命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Cap. This won't kill you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.01,1:31:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但还是会挺疼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it ain't gonna tickle either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.85,1:32:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旺达 我觉得你伤了幻视的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanda, I think you hurt Vision's feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.86,1:32:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把我关在房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You locked me in my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.25,1:32:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 首先 这说法太夸张了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. First, that's an exaggeration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.90,1:32:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其次 我是为了保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second, I did it to protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.33,1:32:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 克林特 - 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Clint. - Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.76,1:32:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来退休生活不适合你 高尔夫打烦了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly retirement doesn't suit you. You got tired of shooting golf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.40,1:32:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我玩18杆 杆杆进洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I played 18, shot 18.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.87,1:32:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是射不偏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just can't seem to miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.53,1:32:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 凡事总有第一次啊 - 让你转头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- First time for everything. - Made you look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.65,1:32:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,检测到多处挫伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Multiple contusions detected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.57,1:32:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我也检测到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I detected that too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.88,1:32:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.25,1:32:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计 这是你丢的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, buddy, I think you lost this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.75,1:33:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这翅膀是碳化纤维的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those wings carbon fiber?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.27,1:33:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意是你射出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this stuff coming out of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.58,1:33:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是 这刚柔度就不难理解了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would explain the rigidity flexibility ratio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.76,1:33:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得说 真是牛逼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which, gotta say, that's awesome man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.28,1:33:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你参没参加过战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you've been a fight before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.86,1:33:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们一般没这么多废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's usually not this much talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.54,1:33:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 不好意思 我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, sorry, my bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.96,1:33:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位 我也想继续和你们打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, look. I'd love to keep this up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.40,1:33:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我今天只有一项任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've only got one job here today{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.85,1:33:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得给斯塔克先生留个好印象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I gotta impress Mr. Stark,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.26,1:33:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉了 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so, I'm really sorry. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.91,1:33:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能早点那么做吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't have done that earlier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.64,1:33:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.45,1:33:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.32,1:33:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,队长 接着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cap, heads up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.53,1:33:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朝这玩意扔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw it at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.31,1:33:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.09,1:33:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.48,1:33:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐 我以为是辆水车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man. I thought it was a water truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.97,1:34:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.31,1:34:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我现在被惹毛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright. Now, I'm pissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.54,1:34:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是计划的一部分吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this part of the plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.96,1:34:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来计划对他们客气些的 想加大火力吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my plan was go easy on them. You want to switch it up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.55,1:34:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们的飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's our ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.67,1:34:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.65,1:34:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗杰斯队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Rogers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.83,1:34:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你相信自己是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you believe what you're doing is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.54,1:34:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但为了大局 你必须马上投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, for the collective good, you must surrender now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.87,1:34:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do, Cap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.66,1:34:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.71,1:35:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这下可好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna end well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.10,1:35:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们没打算停下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not stopping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.59,1:35:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不会停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither are we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.75,1:35:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们还是朋友吧 - 要看你下手多狠了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're still friends, right? - Depends on how hard you hit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.20,1:35:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你放水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were pulling your punches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.45,1:36:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我没杀你父亲 - 那你跑什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't kill your father. - Then why did you run?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.83,1:36:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意根本不符合物理定律啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing does not obey the laws of physics at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.59,1:36:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子 这里有很多你不懂的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look kid. There's a lot going on here that you don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.78,1:36:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克先生说过你会这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark said you'd say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.25,1:36:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还说要攻击你的腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also said to go for your legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.02,1:36:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克林特 能帮我甩掉他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clint, can you get him off me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.91,1:36:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抓紧了吗 - 抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Buckled in? - Yeah. No, I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.54,1:36:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧了 弓箭男 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good, arrow-guy. Let's go. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.35,1:37:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克还跟你说别的了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stark tell you anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.81,1:37:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你错了 你觉得你没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you're wrong. You think you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.30,1:37:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That makes you dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.91,1:37:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说得也没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess he had a point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.03,1:37:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你挺有勇气 你从哪来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got heart, kid. Where're you from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.23,1:37:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皇后区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.68,1:37:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我布鲁克林的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.09,1:37:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 星期五 - 部分武器系统离线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- F.R.I.D.A.Y.? - We have some weapon systems offline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.26,1:37:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.26,1:37:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,估计得返厂维修了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you.. you're gonna have to take this into the shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.96,1:37:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁在说话 - 你的良心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's speaking? - It's your conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.29,1:37:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们最近都没怎么交流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't talk a lot these days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.27,1:38:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 星期五 - 启动灭火系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- F.R.I.D.A.Y.? - Deploying fire suppression system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.06,1:38:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.22,1:38:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了 那家伙现在都该到西伯利亚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to go. That guy's probably in Siberia by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.47,1:38:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得把会飞的引开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta draw out the fliers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.12,1:38:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应付幻视 你去飞机那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take Vision. You get to the jet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.91,1:38:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你们去上飞机 你俩都去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you get to the jet! Both of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.96,1:38:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们其他人走不了了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of us aren't getting out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.44,1:38:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我不想承认 如果我们想打赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As much as I hate to admit it, if we're gonna win this one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.27,1:38:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就得有些人输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some of us might have to lose it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.11,1:38:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是真正重要的战斗 史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't the real fight, Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.46,1:38:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 山姆 什么计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, Sam, what's the plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.03,1:38:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得搞个大动静来转移注意力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a diversion, something big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.13,1:38:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个大家伙 但坚持不了多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got something kind of big, but I can't hold it very long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.44,1:38:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我信号 拼命跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my signal, run like hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.65,1:38:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我把自己扯成了两半 也别回来救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I tear myself in half, don't come back for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.49,1:38:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他要把自己扯成两半了 - 你没问题吗 斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's gonna tear himself in half? - You sure about this, Scott?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.86,1:38:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我经常这样做 其实就那么一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do it all the time. I mean once...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.65,1:38:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在实验室里 然后我晕过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a lab. Then I passed out.{\r}
