Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.64,1:49:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,日内瓦的西奥·布鲁萨尔医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Geneva within the hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.53,1:49:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此人去找到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was met by this man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.97,1:49:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你用面部识别查过他了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you run facial recognition yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.50,1:49:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当我是什么人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.05,1:49:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说不好 我一直脑补一个红发女子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, I've been picturing a redhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.43,1:49:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想的肯定是别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be thinking of someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.60,1:49:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.37,1:49:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假医生实为赫尔穆特·泽莫上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fake doctor's actually Colonel Helmut Zemo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.43,1:49:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,索科威亚情报部门的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sokovian intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.78,1:49:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泽莫带领索科威亚的秘密刺杀小队回音蝎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zemo ran Echo Scorpion, a Sokovian covert kill squad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.49,1:49:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真布鲁萨尔呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what happened to the real Broussard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.88,1:49:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他被发现死在了一家柏林酒店的房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was found dead in a Berlin hotel room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.24,1:49:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警方还在房间里找到了假发和面部假体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where police also found a wig and facial prosthesis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.90,1:49:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用于模拟詹姆斯·布坎南·巴恩斯的特征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}approximating the appearance of one James Buchanan Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.18,1:49:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.87,1:49:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 发给罗斯 - 是 老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get this to Ross. - Yes, Boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.32,1:51:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是孤岛监狱控制中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Raft Prison control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.34,1:51:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以降落了 斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are clear for landing, Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.61,1:51:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 拿到文件了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So? You got the files?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.51,1:51:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们调整卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's reroute the satellites,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.71,1:51:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始对这个泽莫进行面部识别扫描吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}start facial scanning for this Zemo guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.87,1:52:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在莱比锡制造了那么大个烂摊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seriously think I'm gonna listen to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.36,1:52:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得我还会听你的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after that fiasco in Leipzig?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.73,1:52:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没被关进这里的监狱就算你走运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky you're not in one of these cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.77,1:52:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,未来学家 先生们 未来学家来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The futurist, gentlemen! The futurist is here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.19,1:52:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他能看穿一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sees all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.50,1:52:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他知道什么是为你好 不管你喜不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows what's best for you, whether your like it or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.13,1:52:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,饶了我吧 巴顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a break, Barton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.42,1:52:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他们会把你们关在这里 别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had no idea they'd put you here, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.84,1:52:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们会把我们关起来的 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, you knew they'd put us somewhere, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.36,1:52:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 但不是一个漂浮在海上的超级监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. But, not some super-max floating ocean pokey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.30,1:53:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方是关疯子 关…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, this place is for maniacs. This is a place for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.08,1:53:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Criminals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.71,1:53:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罪犯 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Criminals, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.92,1:53:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是想说这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that's the word you're looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.70,1:53:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.29,1:53:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这词以前可不会指我 或山姆 旺达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't used to mean me, or Sam, or Wanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.19,1:53:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们还是被关进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.04,1:53:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你犯法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause you broke the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.22,1:53:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是啊 - 我可没逼你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - I didn't make you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.64,1:53:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 啦啦啦 - 你知法 还犯法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blah, blah, blah... - You read it, you broke it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.39,1:53:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个大老爷们了 有妻有子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, you're all grown-up. You got a wife and kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.60,1:53:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.30,1:53:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你选错队的时候怎么不去考虑他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you think about them before you choose the wrong side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.04,1:53:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家可得提防这家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta watch your back with this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.26,1:53:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好他要背后坑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a chances he's gonna break it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.91,1:53:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉克·皮姆一向说 斯塔克家人的人不能信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank Pym always said, you never can trust a Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.93,1:53:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.97,1:53:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.28,1:53:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗德怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's Rhodes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.24,1:53:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天他要被送去哥大医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they're flying him to Columbia Medical tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.92,1:53:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望有帮助吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... Fingers cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.30,1:53:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要什么吗 他们给你饭吃了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you need? They feed you yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.86,1:54:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在是唱红脸的警察了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the good cop now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.12,1:54:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想知道史蒂夫去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just a guy who needs to know where Steve went.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.83,1:54:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你得去找个唱白脸的来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you better go get a bad cop,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.78,1:54:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要我开口 除非像马克·福尔曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cause you gonna have to go Mark Fuhrman' on my ass{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.78,1:54:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.67,1:54:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样对我动大刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get information out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.10,1:54:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把他们监控的音频关掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I just knocked the 'A' out of their 'AV'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.26,1:54:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有30秒时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got about 30 seconds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.36,1:54:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他们就会发现不是设备问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before they realize it's not their equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.23,1:54:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么 把声音调出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do? Get it back up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.15,1:54:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.05,1:54:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是本该审问巴恩斯的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause that is the fellow who was supposed to interrogate Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.23,1:54:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我显然是错了 山姆 我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly, I made a mistake. Sam, I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.79,1:54:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是头一遭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.41,1:54:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,队长现在不知要遭遇什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cap is definitely off the reservation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.21,1:54:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会需要一切的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he's about to need all the help he can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.02,1:54:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不怎么熟 你不非得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know each other very well. You don't have to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.41,1:54:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.68,1:54:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'll tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.42,1:54:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你得作为朋友单独去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you have to go alone and as a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.27,1:54:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.44,1:55:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克 他说出罗杰斯的下落了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stark, did he give you anything on Rogers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.21,1:55:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没 他叫我下地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. Told me to go to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.27,1:55:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是回基地吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going back to the compound instead. But,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.74,1:55:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你随时可以打给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can call me anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.05,1:55:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你待机 我喜欢看电话闪灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll put you on hold, I like to watch the line blink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.04,1:56:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(罗曼诺夫)
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.97,1:56:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得那次我们不得不搭冷藏车坐在后面冷库里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember that time we had to ride back from Rockaway Beach{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.27,1:56:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回洛克威海滩吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the back of that freezer truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.99,1:56:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你拿我们坐地铁的钱买了热狗的那次吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that the time you used our train money to buy hot dogs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.69,1:56:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为了替个红发女赢一只玩具熊花了3美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You blew 3 bucks trying to win that stuffed bear for a redhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.73,1:56:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她叫什么来着 - 朵丽丝 你叫她小朵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was her name again? - Dolores. You called her Dot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.80,1:56:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她现在肯定都一百岁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's got to be a hundred years old right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.80,1:56:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也是 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So are we, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.55,1:56:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定也就到了几小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't have been here more than a few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.82,1:56:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那也足以唤醒他们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long enough to wake them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.00,1:57:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.30,1:57:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.11,1:57:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你戒心有点强啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem a little defensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.30,1:57:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天挺不容易的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a long day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.18,1:57:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稍息 士兵 我现在不是冲你来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At ease, soldier. I'm not currently after you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.14,1:57:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你来做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.64,1:57:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你的说法没那么扯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be your story's not so crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.49,1:58:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.00,1:58:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯不知道我来了 我也不希望他知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ross has no idea I'm here, I'd like to keep it that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.86,1:58:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则 我还得逮捕自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, I got to arrest myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.93,1:58:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听上去要办很多公文呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that sounds like a lot of paper work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.48,1:58:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 见到你很高兴 托尼 - 我也是 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's good to see you, Tony. - You too, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.50,1:58:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洗脑战士 被你打败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manchurian Candidate, you're killing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.50,1:58:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.14,1:58:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们休战了 你可以把枪放下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a truce here, you can drop...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.33,1:58:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我读取到热信号 - 几个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got heat signatures. - How many?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.15,1:58:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.13,1:59:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这算是安慰 他们是在睡梦中死去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's any comfort, they died in their sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.70,1:59:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为我还想要更多你这样的人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you really think I wanted more of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.75,1:59:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.51,1:59:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我感激他们 他们把你引来了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm grateful to them though, they brought you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.76,1:59:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别费劲了 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.42,1:59:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏联人将这个房间设计成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Soviets built this chamber to withstand the launch blast of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.20,1:59:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以抵挡UR100导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}UR-100 rockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.21,1:59:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打赌我有更强的火力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm betting I can beat that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.04,1:59:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你 斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm sure you could, Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.42,1:59:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假以时日的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Given time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.36,1:59:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那样你就无从知道你为何而来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then you'd never know why you came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.16,1:59:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在维也纳滥杀无辜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed innocent people in Vienna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.63,1:59:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就为了引我们来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just to bring us here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.48,2:00:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一年多来 我满脑子都是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've thought about nothing else for over a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.91,2:00:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,研究你 跟踪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I studied you, I followed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.34,2:00:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在你站在这里 我才意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now that you're standing here, I just realized...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.21,2:00:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的蓝眼睛中还带点绿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a bit of green in the blue of your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.23,2:00:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能发现瑕疵真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How nice to find a flaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.34,2:00:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是索科威亚人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Sokovian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.98,2:00:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是为了这个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what this is about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.55,2:00:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,索科威亚被你炸毁前早就无药可救了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sokovia was a failed state long before you blew it to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.06,2:00:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.38,2:00:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了我的一个承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here because I made a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.95,2:00:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你失去了什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.98,2:00:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.94,2:00:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so will you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.03,2:00:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(1991年12月16日)
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.99,2:00:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被敌人颠覆的帝国还能东山再起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An empire toppled by its enemies can rise again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.44,2:01:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但从内部坍塌的帝国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But one which crumbles from within...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.14,2:01:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就永远灭亡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's dead... forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.57,2:01:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认得这条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.18,2:01:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(1991年12月16日)
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.65,2:01:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.91,2:01:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.78,2:01:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.71,2:01:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴恩斯中士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.40,2:01:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍华德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.31,2:02:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍华德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.95,2:02:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尼 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony. Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.65,2:02:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.27,2:02:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know it was him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.61,2:03:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别骗我 罗杰斯 你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bullshit me, Rogers! Did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.63,2:03:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.05,2:04:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.60,2:04:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是他 托尼 九头蛇控制了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't him, Tony. Hydra had control of his mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.85,2:04:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.84,2:04:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.73,2:04:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,左靴喷气系统损坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left boot-jet failing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.09,2:04:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞行系统受损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight systems compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.73,2:04:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.63,2:04:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会罢休的 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not gonna stop. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.50,2:05:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.25,2:05:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞄准系统损坏 老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Targeting system's knackered, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.43,2:05:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我用肉眼瞄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm eyeballing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.09,2:05:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得他们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you even remember them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.95,2:05:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得每一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember all of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.57,2:06:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这改变不了过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't gonna change what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.69,2:06:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.59,2:06:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他杀了我妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He killed my mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.50,2:07:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真该看到他那张小脸 尽量赶回来 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've seen his little face. Just try, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.97,2:07:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要睡了 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to bed. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.63,2:07:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我差点杀错了人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost kill the wrong man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.13,2:07:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不是什么无辜的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hardly an innocent one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.76,2:07:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0001,,(信息已删除)
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.41,2:07:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你想要的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all you wanted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.02,2:07:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他们自相残杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To see them rip each other apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.41,2:07:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲住在城外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father lived outside the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.08,2:07:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为那儿会很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we would be safe there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.85,2:07:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我儿子很兴奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son was excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.03,2:07:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可以透过车窗看到钢铁侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could see the Iron Man from the car window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.72,2:07:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉我妻子:"不用担心"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I told my wife, "Don't worry."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.21,2:07:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"他们在城里打仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"They're fighting in the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.15,2:07:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们离得远呢 不会有事"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are miles from harm."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.39,2:08:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等灰烬散尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the dust cleared,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.44,2:08:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尖叫声停止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the screaming stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.68,2:08:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花了两天才找到他们的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took me two days until I found their bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.04,2:08:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.38,2:08:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,依然抱着我的妻儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}still holding my wife and son in his arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.29,2:08:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而复仇者联盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Avengers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.35,2:08:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就那么回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they went home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.01,2:08:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道自己杀不了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew I couldn't kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.63,2:08:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比我更强大的人都试过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More powerful men than me have tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.99,2:08:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我能让他们自相残杀呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, if I could get them to kill each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.21,2:08:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲的事我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.33,2:08:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他似乎是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seemed a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.93,2:08:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个孝子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a dutiful son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.22,2:09:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,复仇已经吞噬了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vengeance has consumed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.66,2:09:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也吞噬了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's consuming them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.84,2:09:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让自己也被吞噬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am done letting it consume me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.80,2:09:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正义很快就会到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Justice will come soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.41,2:09:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和死人说去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell that to the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.76,2:09:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活人还要找你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The living are not done with you yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.10,2:09:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法靠肉搏打败他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't beat him hand to hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:36.92,2:09:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,分析他的攻击模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Analyse his fight pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.78,2:09:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扫描中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scanning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.19,2:09:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对抗策略就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Countermeasures ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.26,2:09:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们好好揍他一顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's kick his ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.10,2:10:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.32,2:10:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我原本也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So was I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.33,2:10:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要起来 最后警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down. Final warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.78,2:10:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以和你耗一整天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could do this all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.27,2:11:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那块盾牌不属于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That shield doesn't belong to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.17,2:11:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你配不上它 那是我父亲制造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't deserve it! My father made that shield!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.84,2:12:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早上八点 晚上五点吃饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meals at eight and five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:22.60,2:12:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每天可以去两次厕所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toilet privileges, twice a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.75,2:12:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大声说话 电你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raise your voice, zap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.68,2:12:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,碰玻璃 电你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Touch the glass, zap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.93,2:12:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,敢做出格的事 我会收拾你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You step out of line, you deal with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.97,2:12:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你试试看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, step out of line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.50,2:12:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how does it feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:40.72,2:12:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花了那么多时间 费了那么多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spend all that time, all that effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.04,2:12:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.06,2:12:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失败得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see it fail,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.48,2:12:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一塌糊涂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so spectacularly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:54.32,2:12:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.87,2:13:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这只是首次测试 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's just the first pass. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:23.22,2:13:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我反馈 想到什么都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me some feedback. Anything you think of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.41,2:13:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,减震 横向移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shock absorption. Lateral movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.03,2:13:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杯架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cup holder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.94,2:13:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许该考虑在下面按空调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may wanna think about some AC down in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.63,2:13:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我拉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. I'll give you a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.58,2:13:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不 别帮我 别帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, don't. Don't help. Don't help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:54.56,2:13:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,138次 138次战斗任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}138. 138 combat missions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.24,2:14:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我飞过138次战斗任务 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how many I've flown, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:01.38,2:14:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每次都可能有去无回 但我还是去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every one of them could've been my last, but I flew them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.52,2:14:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为那是必须打的仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause the fight needed to be fought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.69,2:14:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个《协议》的事也是一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the same with these Accords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:10.74,2:14:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我签字是因为那是正确的做法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I signed because it was the right thing to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.13,2:14:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事的确太糟心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yeah, this sucks. This is, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:19.60,2:14:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是不走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a bad beat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.48,2:14:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这没改变我的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it hasn't change my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.56,2:14:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.63,2:14:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没事吧 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.24,2:14:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是托尼·"屎塔克"吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you Tony "Stank"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:46.25,2:14:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 他就是托尼·"屎塔克" 你来对地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, this is-this is Tony "Stank"! You're in the right place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.58,2:14:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.61,2:14:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这梗我要用一辈子 - 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Never dropping that, by the way. - Oh, my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.53,2:14:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一人桌"屎塔克"先生 坐在厕所边吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Table for one, Mr. "Stank". Please, by the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.42,2:15:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.67,2:15:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.72,2:15:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴你回到了基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you're back at the compound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.62,2:15:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望你一个人在豪宅里晃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like the idea of you rattling around a mansion by yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.09,2:15:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都需要家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all need family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.80,2:15:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,复仇者联盟属于你 或许多于属于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Avengers are yours, maybe more so than mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.40,2:15:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从18岁开始就是一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been on my own since I was 18.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.71,2:15:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从未真正融入哪里 哪怕是在军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never really fit in anywhere, even in the army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.87,2:15:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我信任 人 个体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My faith's in... people, I guess. Individuals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.25,2:15:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴 大部分时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, I'm happy to say that for the most part,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.62,2:15:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们没让我失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they haven't let me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:41.34,2:15:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我也不能辜负他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why I can't let them down either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:47.73,2:15:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,锁可以换 但或许不该换\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locks can be replaced, but, maybe they shouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.05,2:15:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我伤了你 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I hurt you, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:55.34,2:15:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我大概是觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guessed I thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.59,2:16:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不告诉你你父母的事 是照顾你的感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by not telling you about your parents, I was sparing you. But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.04,2:16:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我现在明白 我只是在照顾自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see now that I was really sparing myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.12,2:16:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.26,2:16:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你有天能理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully one day you can understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.27,2:16:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也希望我们能在《协议》的事上达成一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish we agree on the Accords,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.02,2:16:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:12.86,2:16:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你只是在做你相信的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're doing what you believe in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.26,2:16:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我们也都只能做到这点 我们也该这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's all any of us can do. That's all any of us should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.46,2:16:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国务卿罗斯的优先来电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Priority call from Secretary Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:19.54,2:16:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,孤岛监狱遭人劫狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been a breach at the Raft Prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:23.16,2:16:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 接过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, put him through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.48,2:16:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 托尼 我们有麻烦了 - 请待机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tony, we have a problem. - Ah, please hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:28.27,2:16:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.50,2:16:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 不管怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, no matter what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.11,2:16:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.36,2:16:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你需要我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you need us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.76,2:16:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你需要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you need me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.41,2:16:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.42,2:18:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,《美国队长3：内战》
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.19,2:18:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.05,2:18:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能信任自己的大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't trust my own mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:53.71,2:18:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到他们想到办法把洗脑的东西清理掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, until they figure out how to get this stuff out of my head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:56.33,2:18:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想继续沉睡是最好的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think going back under is the best thing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.80,2:19:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对所有人都好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:23.32,2:19:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.17,2:19:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友和我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend and my father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:30.08,2:19:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是受害者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they were both victims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.46,2:19:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能帮其中一个找到安宁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can help one of them find peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.81,2:19:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们知道他在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if they find out he's here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.77,2:19:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就会来抓他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll come for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:46.41,2:19:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们试试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let them try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:29.50,2:26:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁啊 是谁打了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So. Who was it? Who hit you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:32.50,2:26:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是有个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:33.83,2:26:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,痒死了 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So itchy, man. God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:35.38,2:26:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有个人叫什么 - 史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's some guy's name? - Uh, Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:38.22,2:26:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:39.34,2:26:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哎呦 - 12C那个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yikes. - From 12C?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:41.00,2:26:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,龅牙那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the overbite?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.04,2:26:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 你不认识他 他布鲁克林的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. You don't know him, he's from Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:48.78,2:26:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:50.45,2:26:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你也回敬他了几下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope you got a few good licks in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.13,2:26:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我回敬了他好几下呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I got quite a few in actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.26,2:26:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:55.19,2:26:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他朋友块头可大了 可大可大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His friend was huge. Like huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:00.94,2:27:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样好多了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's way better. Thank you.{\r}
